  "notes": [
    "Existing native symbol pin order is retained. Nine lower-edge MCU pins use a monotonic non-crossing fan-out.",
    "U301 pins 15,16,26,28,29,30 remain intentional NC.",
    "J301/J302/J303 remain DNP. All five pushbuttons explicitly join 1/2 as signal and3/4 as GND, per native symbol and Omron B3F internal connections.",
    "Each named-wire label should be rendered at 6-7 schematic units, with local page-net names shortened by root mapping; label placement requires native export visual review.",
    "Two decoupling capacitors share local supply/ground rails at x110..230, left of U301 actual body. U301 bodyBounds uses native esym RECT [-75,+145,+75,-130], not a pin-envelope estimate.",
    "R301,C303,SW301 form the visible reset RC branch. No electrical specification or logical mapping changes.",
    "2026-11-16: correct initial electrical assumption: native B3F always-connected pin groups are1/2 and3/4. Requires approved native pin-map/netlist reference update and live re-export, not PCB-only net edits."
  ]
